    {"m": "mc", "if": "exp", "r": "On days other than Corpus Christi and its octave when the Sacrament is exposed, a solemn Mass of the Blessed Sacrament is celebrated, with the due commemorations; the conventual Mass of the Office of the day is also said (or one Mass is sung of the day, with a commemoration of the Sacrament).", "ref": ["varia-ii-2"]},
    {"m": "smc", "if": "tab", "r": "The Sacrament is in the tabernacle: the bows made at the middle of the altar on arriving and leaving become genuflexions.", "ref": ["praeparatio-ii-8", "modus-xv-4"]}
